# `may-not-end`: a top-level widget block is a definition of the shrink check (Semantics
# ch. 7: "a widget function that binds itself is held to the same test"). `@looped` binds
# `@again`, which binds `@looped`, so building either never ends; `@fine` binds a widget
# that binds a label, and checks clean.
emit Ui.*

@looped: @unit
@looped:
    Ui.Label($text=$"x")
    @again

@again: @unit
@again:
    @looped

@fine: @unit
@fine:
    @leaf
    Ui.Label($text=$"y")

@leaf: @unit
@leaf:
    Ui.Label($text=$"z")
